 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "How To Survive As a Villain on the Verge of Death"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "사망 직전의 악녀로 살아남는 방법"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "She wakes up as Princess Ivnes von Albion, a notorious villainess destined to be killed.\n\nBut dying a meaningless death? No way. She decides to stop her vicious behavior and even manages to strike a deal with the fiancé who once despised her.\n\nSo why does the danger keep coming?\n\nNow the supposed “business-only” contract fiancé, who’s actually the hidden mastermind, starts obsessing over her. And the original male lead suddenly wants to protect her instead of the heroine?\n\nAll she wanted was to survive.. Where did this world start to go wrong?"
  },
